{"4979300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doamari", "steam_appid": 4979300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It'll take you somewhere, somewhere to see</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new place, a place you'll want to be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >START A BRAWL and fight a beast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do nothing and invite it to a feast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could go to any place that you could imagine in you head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or sit and do nothing until the day you're dead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the walls aren't fake and the tree's aren't too...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/50495160f6c9f245723c035cce90b125.avif?t=1788225421\" width=578 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/974df327bf00d644d237897523f9baf9.avif?t=1788225421\" width=550 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/5349c6ede4d14acff06bc1ea90e2b847.poster.avif?t=1788225421\" width=312 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/5349c6ede4d14acff06bc1ea90e2b847.webm?t=1788225421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/5349c6ede4d14acff06bc1ea90e2b847.mp4?t=1788225421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doamari is an RPG about strange people, places, and things.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT ENEMIES with traditional turned based RPG mechanics, with original battles and lots and lots of weapons and abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/019919d4f002ecdd379b0d85a5290511.avif?t=1788225421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras_big/019919d4f002ecdd379b0d85a5290511.avif?t=1788225421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PINEAPPLE!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE Doamari's the weird world and slowly uncover the truth of DOAMARI. Make 100s of friends and even 1 enemy (you know who you are).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/84bd5e2f79943fc5b1ab43fabeb1348b.avif?t=1788225421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras_big/84bd5e2f79943fc5b1ab43fabeb1348b.avif?t=1788225421 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>That's Iris.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take in the mixed media art style. Between claymation, pixel art, and hand drawn sprites, there's many different angles to take in.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/58134b3ccad18075c985202dd4ff28fb.avif?t=1788225421\" width=804 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't worry they are sleeping... I think.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every day there is something new to see... and new to be.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting tomatoes (or Raymatos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tougher optional bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic cones... so many traffic cones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a friend (somehow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go into a cave</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at this ugly worm boy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/d95342ed1b01285f994e6d5da8aa18dc.avif?t=1788225421\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is he like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hate him.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It'll take you somewhere, somewhere to see</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new place, a place you'll want to be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >START A BRAWL and fight a beast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do nothing and invite it to a feast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could go to any place that you could imagine in you head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or sit and do nothing until the day you're dead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the walls aren't fake and the tree's aren't too...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979300/extras/50495160f6c9f245723c035cce90b125.avif?t=1788225421\" width=578 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama